      | W01  | A-01 |          | ITEM_STORAGE_ALREADY_EXISTS   |
      | W01  |      | -1       | ITEM_STORAGE_MAX_QTY_INVALID  |
      |      |      |          | WAREHOUSE_CODE_EMPTY          |

